[重构思路] 复用 fileUtils.isWithinRoot，让所有工具的越界判定只有一份实现；同时在方法开头取出 targetDir 局部变量，避免同一个条件里三次调用 getTargetDir()。代码示例：
```ts
private resolveAndValidatePath(relativePath?: string): string {
  const targetDir = this.config.getTargetDir();
  const targetPath = path.resolve(targetDir, relativePath || '.');
  if (!isWithinRoot(targetPath, targetDir)) {
    throw new Error(
      `Path validation failed: Attempted path "${relativePath || '.'}" resolves outside the allowed root directory "${targetDir}".`,
    );
  }
  // ...
}
```

[重构思路] 与 grep 保持一致，统一走 isWithinRoot，并且把 targetDir 提到方法开头只取一次。代码示例：
```ts
const targetDir = this.config.getTargetDir();
// ...
if (!isWithinRoot(absoluteFilePath, targetDir)) {
  skippedFiles.push({
    path: absoluteFilePath,
    reason: `Security: Glob library returned path outside target directory. Base: ${targetDir}, Path: ${absoluteFilePath}`,
  });
  continue;
}
```

[重构思路] 在函数入口显式声明契约：非绝对路径直接返回 false（或抛错），让安全判定只对绝对路径生效，并在 JSDoc 中写明。代码示例：
```ts
export function isWithinRoot(pathToCheck: string, rootDirectory: string): boolean {
  if (!path.isAbsolute(pathToCheck) || !path.isAbsolute(rootDirectory)) {
    return false; // 安全判定只接受绝对路径
  }
  const normalizedPathToCheck = path.resolve(pathToCheck);
  const normalizedRootDirectory = path.resolve(rootDirectory);
  // ...
}
```

[重构思路] 直接使用 searchDirAbsolute 并删除 fallback；若确需回退，应用显式的存在性判断而非字符串真值判断。代码示例：
```ts
const searchDirAbsolute = path.resolve(
  this.config.getTargetDir(),
  params.path || '.',
);
if (!isWithinRoot(searchDirAbsolute, this.config.getTargetDir())) {
  return `Search path ("${searchDirAbsolute}") resolves outside the tool's root directory.`;
}
// 后续直接使用 searchDirAbsolute
```

